      "sourceGame": "agencyProtocol",
      "q": "Full coverage causes expected avoidable loss of 40. A deductible prevents 18 but sacrifices 13 in valued risk protection. Inspections prevent 15 and cost 7. Using both prevents 24, with both costs still incurred. Other effects are equal. Which design has greatest net value?",
